Verse 1:
[C]Let us praise the [F]name of the [G]Lord! [C]Give Him [F]glory, [Dm]A[G7]men. [C]
[C]Amen, [F]a[G]men, [C]Amen, [Dm]a[G7]men. [C]

Verse 2:
[C]Go ye into [F]all the [G]world. [C]Alle[F]luia, [Dm]A[G7]men. [C]
[C]Amen, [F]a[G]men, [C]Amen, [Dm]a[G7]men. [C]
